MAPS AND DESIGNATIONS
The designations used for the maps in this report are the 1986 pre-war geographic regions and
boundaries of Somalia. These do not imply any expression of opinion whatsoever on the part of
UNFPA concerning the legal status of any administration and its authorities. It is important to note
that regions and districts have changed and the newly established regions may have no link to the
pre-war regional and district boundaries used in this analysis.
